Bimi Boo with you again! This time you will go to visit friends of Bimi Boo, who live in a treehouse. You will meet a sly cat, funny rabbit and cute squirrel. There is an exciting game in the house of your baby in which he can help to bring order, to place everything in its place and feed friends of Bimi Boo.

15 different games will fascinate a child with not only bright colors and funny animations, but also with interesting and clear tasks such as:

- Arrange items by color, shape, number and size;
- Pick up items within the meaning of;
- Arrange the geometric shapes according to silhouette;
- Sort items in its place
- Feed animals in a right way;
- Restore pictures from memory.

Together with Bimi Boo Shapes & Colors, your baby will learn to distinguish shapes, colors, texture and quantity. The game also improves fine motor skills, attention and intelligence. It contains everything you need for a fun and healthy development of the child.

Explore the modern medical center, and create your stories as a doctor, patient, or scientist! With unique gameplay, learn how to prevent infections with vaccines, masks, and hand disinfection in a fun and interactive way. 

FUTURE CLINIC AND CUTE BOTS 

This game takes you to a flu clinic of the future, where you'll meet 7 child-friendly robots serving as doctors and medical staff. This medical center is filled with the latest interactive technologies in every part of the building, ready for you to explore and create your stories. From a bacteria lab to a helicopter ambulance, from a lobby filled with mini games to a science lab. 

NEW HOSPITAL EXPERIENCES 

Like in the first edition of Pepi Hospital, this flu clinic of the future invites you to be creative and come up with your own stories. It’s also filled with a wide range of new activities. Become a doctor and treat patients with the latest interactive devices. Prevent infections with anti-virus vaccines. Play the role of a scientist and experiment with bacteria using cool science lab equipment. Or take on the role of a patient and receive care from adorable Pepi robots. 

INTERACTIVE GAMEPLAY 

The medical center is full of unique gameplay elements to make your future flu clinic stories even more enjoyable and unforgettable. Each room has a variety of interactive areas for you to explore, including smart screens that can help doctors to identify patients’ needs, science lab equipment to experiment with, and a mini-games screen in the lobby. 

KEEP THE EDUCATION FUN 

This game is perfect for families who want to play and learn together. Join the kids as they explore the medical center's exciting features, guide their exploration, and help them learn about the spread of diseases, the importance of vaccines, and simple ways to stay healthy. You can also help them make up stories with different characters, teach them about basic medical tools, and expand their vocabulary.

KEY FEATURES: 
• Unique gameplay that simulates virus infections; 
• Colorful and engaging graphics showcasing flu clinic of the future; 
• 30+ amazing characters: doctors, patients, robots, and visitors; 
• 7 friendly robot doctors to help treat patients; 
• A science lab with different bacteria to experiment with; 
• Mini-games screen with 3 enjoyable games; 
• Explore dozens of medical devices, items, and machines to experiment with; 
• A helicopter ambulance to transport patients to the hospital roof;
 • A great way to learn about hygiene and preventing the nasty flu!
